T:</em> Enjoy the benefits of creatine without the hassle, in a yummy, easy-to-digest form.<br><em></em></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>TASTES DELICIOUS:&nbsp;</em>Amazing natural strawberry flavour. It&rsquo;s hard to stop at three!</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>SUGAR FREE:&nbsp;</em>Indulge in sweetness minus the sugar. Perfect for your health journey and vegan-friendly.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><em>TRAVEL FRIENDLY:&nbsp;</em>No more taking white powders on planes! Safe for carry-on or checked.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Payment terms:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer 10% Commission paid directly to you</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>Other information:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Join the Elite Motiv Affiliate Program and earn great commissions while being part of a growing community focused on a stronger, healthier, and tastier future. Stay motivated and on the path to success as you unlock your full potential.<em></em></p>",
